# Caravan Rest (CIPlay vi_caravan_rest): quest "Odo's Rocket" (6 steps)
# The camp round the well (0 0, 4 m), the camp board at 2.5 -7, Odo's locker at -4.6 1.2, the rocket caravan at 26 12
# (5 m), the hyena den round 24 -20, the dune cave's chest at -12.5 31 (2.25 m). offset: set in phase 2 from the
# island's place in the test world.
island Caravan Rest
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Odo's Rocket
wait 5
expect animals Hyena 3
zone caravan_ring
expect step 1
read Camp board
expect step 2
kill Hyena
expect step 3
use rocket
expect message empty socket
open Odo's locker
expect step 4
open Chest in the dune cave
wait 3
expect story sparkplug 1
expect step 5
use rocket
expect story rocketlit 1
expect story sparkplug 0
expect done
